#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:38
msgid "System ID Feature Operation"
msgstr "System ID 功能操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:9
#: d30ec13def3c435ca38cccaa6bdd3968
msgid "System Identification Feature"
msgstr "系统辨识功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:11
#: 09125bb8b57048f89bd89d5e4ef4da9e
msgid ""
"The System Identification feature is for advanced users and provides a means"
" to characterize the response of a vehicle in the frequency domain.  The "
"flight data collected from this mode can be used in several ways:"
msgstr ""
"系统辨识（System Identification）功能面向高级用户，用于在频域上刻画载具的响应特性。该模式收集的飞行数据可用于多种用途："

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:13
#: 0124dc4e404f4e6880eac136778e5cfb
msgid ""
"generating mathematical models of the vehicles flight behavior for model "
"generation"
msgstr "生成飞行器飞行行为的数学模型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:14
#: 2a6a7d19ec80452187d396baf03cb508
msgid "investigating and predicting the quality of the vehicle tune"
msgstr "评估和预测飞行器调参质量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:15
#: 2d8cf17f09704c698c3b98586070cce3
msgid "calculating flying quality metrics"
msgstr "计算飞行品质指标"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:17
#: ad01cf0c10f648fd97e22e9567d20768
msgid ""
"It injects an input signal, called a chirp, at various points in the control"
" loops.  The chirp is a constant amplitude oscillation that increases in "
"frequency from a user defined minimum to maximum frequency, generally "
"referred to as a frequency sweep.  The injection points are defined by the "
":ref:`SID_AXIS<SID_AXIS>` parameter.  The resulting flight data is logged "
"for math analysis and model generation after the flight."
msgstr ""
"它在控制环路的不同位置注入一种称为「chirp」的输入信号。Chirp "
"是一种振幅恒定的振荡信号，频率从用户设定的最小值线性增加到最大值，通常称为频率扫频。注入点由 :ref:`SID_AXIS<SID_AXIS>` "
"参数定义。所得飞行数据会被记录，用于飞行后做数学分析与模型生成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:22
#: 6809fa39c60342f1885e16d0300cd8f2
msgid "Enabling the System Identification Feature"
msgstr "启用系统辨识功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:24
#: 3ffbcef507744fb1bb8b3a1dae7dd165
msgid ""
"This feature is not automatically compiled into the stable version of "
"firmware.  Use the `custom firmware webtool "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ to compile a version for your board. "
"Select the \"system ID support for quadplanes\" under the Plane category."
msgstr ""
"此功能未自动编译进稳定版固件。使用 `自定义固件网页工具 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ 为您的飞控板编译版本。在 "
"Plane 类别下选择「quadplane 的系统 ID 支持」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:27
#: fe85bf9511b9442dadaf3b9865b16aa9
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:29
#: e948693cdcc9498c8813745b1413e1e4
msgid ""
"System ID feature in quadplane is different than copter.  The system ID "
"feature in copter is a separate flight mode.  In quadplane, system ID is run"
" on top of either qstabilize, qhover, or qloiter flight modes.  The system "
"ID feature is started and stopped using an Aux Switch."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 中的系统 ID 功能与 Copter 不同。Copter 中的系统 ID 功能是单独的飞行模式，而在 QuadPlane 中，系统 "
"ID 运行在 QStabilize、QHover 或 QLoiter 飞行模式之上。系统 ID 功能通过辅助开关启动和停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:31
#: fb6d9412970f40e3aa2f68e5241df092
msgid ""
"Set an aux switch on the transmitter to have ``RCx_OPTION`` set to 184 to "
"start/stop operation."
msgstr "将遥控器上的辅助开关设置 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 184 以启动/停止操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:34
#: 48cf0feb13ba4230a84ebf0f57655957
msgid "Further Information"
msgstr "更多信息"

